      "The company remains debt-free with no interest payable, though operational profitability has weakened.",
      "A loss on disposal of assets (£2,761) in 2026 contrasted with a profit on disposal (£1,381) in the prior year.",
      "Subcontractor costs, a major component of staff costs, fell from £163,671 to £120,601, reflecting lower activity levels.",
      "Overall financial performance indicates a challenging year with a marked reduction in both scale and profitability."
